# Feature description: Binned age into categories (e.g., [youth, middle-aged, elderly]) based on quantiles (Q1, Median, Q3).
# Usefulness: Smooths the relationship between age and credit-approval prediction by reducing variance in models sensitive to raw age data while capturing age-related behavioral trends on credit decisions.

